      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are in immense pain right now, and it's understandable that you feel overwhelmed by these feelings of losing yourself. Please know that these thoughts of ending things are serious, and there are people who want to support you through this difficult moment. You can connect with compassionate, trained individuals by calling or texting 988 in the US and Canada, or by calling 111 in the UK. These services are free, confidential, and available 24/7.",
